{"id":5656,"date":"2021-06-08T16:23:48","date_gmt":"2021-06-08T09:23:48","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/?page_id=5656"},"modified":"2025-04-28T14:56:17","modified_gmt":"2025-04-28T07:56:17","slug":"comparative-education-society-of-cambodia","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/comparative-education-society-of-cambodia\/","title":{"rendered":"Comparative Education Society Of Cambodia"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5656\" class=\"elementor elementor-5656\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c11e404 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-content-align-center elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"c11e404\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6f82280\" data-id=\"6f82280\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f43a8cb elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-tm-heading\" data-id=\"f43a8cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;unicampFadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"tm-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tm-modern-heading\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-primary-wrap\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"heading-primary elementor-heading-title\">Comparative Education Society Of Cambodia<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"heading-divider\"><\/div>\n\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-description-wrap\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-description\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Comparative Education Society of Cambodia (CESCam) was established in 2018 by a group of prominent researchers in the field of educational research, but it was not until 2021 that CESCam\u2019s permanent secretariat has been established at CamTech as a focal point for communication and logistics following a board of director\u2019s meeting. Currently, CamTech\u2019s president Dr. Khieng Sothy is also the elected-president of CESCam.<\/p>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e95096e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"e95096e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6d10b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b6d10b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Overall vision of CESCam is to promote comparative education in Cambodia through fostering teaching and research in the area of comparative education, producing publication about Cambodian education and beyond, contributing to advancing philosophy, methodology and methods, and establishing networks with local and international research and educational institutions and other counterpart societies.<\/p><p>CamTech shares a similar vision as CESCam, and the former intends to stimulate intellectual environment and contribute with out-of-the-box thinking and detail-oriented research studies to address key issues in the Cambodian educational system. Our areas of research include:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-e8fbbde elementor-section-column-vertical-align-middle elementor-reverse-tablet elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-gap-beside-no elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e8fbbde\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4140b28\" data-id=\"4140b28\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-07e573b elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-tm-heading\" data-id=\"07e573b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;unicampFadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"tm-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tm-modern-heading\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-description-wrap\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-description\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Economics of education<\/li><li>Innovative and emerging models of education<\/li><li>Digital education<\/li><li>STEAM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Art, and Mathematics) education<\/li><li>Research culture and practice in higher education institutions<\/li><li>Internationalization of higher education<\/li><li>University-Industry partnership<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7e7c5fc\" data-id=\"7e7c5fc\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor